<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Your glorious image, Lord, I see,</l><l>Though faced with my deficiency;</l><l>In lowly times, You came</l><l>And told me, “Call upon My name,”</l><l>That I may fix my heart on Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The One who’s excellent, I see,</l><l>The One who cares so humanly;</l><l>Humanity, divine,</l><l>Thy life so near, we intertwine;</l><l>A life expressing only Thine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
